OL,3,GNEWSACall to make public spaces smoke
OL,4,Aand vape free
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Guernsey businesswoman is calling for
OL,7,Fvaping and smoking to be banned in all
OL,8,Fpublic places.
OL,10,FCurrently vaping within indoor public
OL,11,Fplaces is not illegal, unlike smoking,
OL,12,Fand is at the landlord's discretion
OL,13,Fwhether it is permitted.
OL,15,FNatalia Silvester is CEO of the
OL,16,FSylvester Group, which runs Crepe
OL,17,FMaison and Renoir Tea Garden, and has
OL,18,Fsigned both venues up for a vape and
OL,19,Fsmoke-free initiative.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
