OL,3,GNEWSACall to make public spaces smoke
OL,4,Aand vape free
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlex Hawkins-Drew, associate director
OL,7,Fof Public Health: said "The new
OL,8,FCombined Substance Use Strategy, due to
OL,9,Fcommence in 2027, includes an action to
OL,10,Fconsider the introduction of a ban on
OL,11,Fvaping in indoor public places."
